Gives Sodium Remote's build of SudoVDA its own identity: hardware ID Root\SodiumRemoteDisplay, device interface
{53f76209-42ea-44fd-897e-8607b15fa9be}, trace GUID, INF, DLL, catalog, service and registry names, and the adapter's
names, so it installs beside another program's SudoVDA (Apollo, Sunshine setups) and never touches it.
Applies to SudoVDA at the commit in ../UPSTREAM with `git apply` (build.ps1, run by .github/workflows/sudovda.yml).
The text below is a diff of SudoVDA's own files, which stay under their licences (see ../UPSTREAM).

